गवापति m. bull (lit. master of the cows);
 E. of Agni
and the Sun (lord of the rays).

ग॑विष्टि a. the same;
 f. passion, desire, esp. for
fighting;
 fight, battle.

ग॑व्य a. consisting of, belonging to, coming from cows or
cattle;
 f. गव्या॑ desire for cows or milk, ardour of battle;
 n.
ग॑व्य cattle, milk, pasture-ground.

गव्य॑ a. consisting of, belonging to, coming from cows or
cattle;
 f. गव्या॑ desire for cows or milk, ardour of battle;
 n.
ग॑व्य cattle, milk, pasture-ground.
